silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_03_negative_regression_catalog_concrete_anchor_1#feliscatustaxonrow silm:hasLongDescription "The FelisCatusTaxonRow is The ITIS taxonomy row for Felis catus / TSN 183798 — the species-level database entry, not an individual. This node is the starting point of the blocked path in regression k1 (direct identity to Mittens) and k2 (TSN → Mittens)." .
